---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';import AdminPanel from '../../components/AdminPanel.astro';
---
<Base title="운영 관리" noindex><header class="page-header"><span class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY ADMIN</span><h1>운영 관리.</h1><p>Creator 승인·운영자 지정은 Owner, 게시판·신고 관리는 Moderator와 Owner가 담당합니다.</p></header><AdminPanel/><section class="cs-section"><h2>Creator 콘텐츠 신고</h2><p data-target-admin-status role="status">운영 권한을 확인합니다.</p><div class="cs-list" data-target-reports></div><h2>콘텐츠 숨김 / 복구 / Featured</h2><form class="cs-editor" data-target-moderation><fieldset disabled><label>콘텐츠<select name="target" required data-target-select></select></label><label>처리<select name="action"><option value="hide">숨기기</option><option value="restore">복구하기 (프로젝트는 초안으로)</option><option value="feature">Featured 선정 (Owner)</option><option value="unfeature">Featured 해제 (Owner)</option></select></label><button class="button primary">적용</button></fieldset></form></section><p class="cs-note">MINSEC 사이트 편집은 별도 GitHub 권한이 필요합니다. <a href="https://k-min-sec.github.io/admin/content/">MINSEC 콘텐츠 편집 →</a></p><script>import '../../lib/target-admin';</script></Base>
